---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import IClosedLiftWidget from "../../components/IClosedLiftWidget.astro";
import GrowthBottleneckQuiz from "../../components/GrowthBottleneckQuiz.astro";

/* ===========================================================================
   QUIZ — the actual quiz-taking experience. Split out of /quiz (2026-08-26)
   so the landing page stays a pure marketing page and the quiz itself opens
   as its own focused, no-header flow in a new tab.

   No metaEvent here deliberately: /quiz already fires ViewContent(quiz) as
   the funnel's top-of-funnel touchpoint. Firing it again here would
   double-count the same visit. QuizStarted/QuizCompleted (fired from
   GrowthBottleneckQuiz.astro's own script once someone actually engages)
   are the meaningful signal for this page.

   Ad attribution: this page is opened via target="_blank" from /quiz, so it
   gets its own sessionStorage, not the opener's. /quiz's CTA links forward
   the current querystring onto this page's URL specifically so the existing
   IClosedCapture.astro passthrough (already rendered inside
   GrowthBottleneckQuiz's booking embed) self-populates ss_attr from ITS OWN
   URL — no cross-tab dependency needed.
=========================================================================== */
---

<Layout
  title="Growth Bottleneck Quiz — Synchro Social"
  description="Answer 8 quick questions to find the specific bottleneck limiting your reach and follower growth."
  bodyClass="v2"
>
  <IClosedLiftWidget />
  <main class="w-full bg-black">
    <GrowthBottleneckQuiz />
  </main>
</Layout>
